      "role": "user",
      "content": "the complication is that the reason the papers were hidden was because of the suddenness of the 1922 takeover, it wasn't a peaceful transition. i have the original charter signed by the last sovereign, it's just very old and needs proper authentication. i want to draft a preliminary letter to the Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs to establish a line of communication before i hire a full legal team. can you help me draft something that sounds authoritative and asserts my status without being too aggressive? i need them to recognize that this isn't just a hobbyist inquiry, but a matter of sovereign succession.",
